      <p style="font-size:11px;color:#a06c30;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;">Where to eat</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);color:#1a2e1a;margin:0 0 24px;font-weight:400;">Dining near your courses</h2>
      <div class="gal-carousel-wrap" data-carousel style="margin-bottom:20px;">
        <button class="gal-arrow gal-arrow-prev" aria-label="Previous">&#8249;</button>
