      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,42px);color:#f5f0e8;margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;">Book a trip like this for your group.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(245,240,232,0.6);max-width:480px;margin:0 auto 32px;line-height:1.7;">Tell us your headcount, dates, and which courses you want. Mike builds a full proposal — tee times, lodging, itinerary — within 24 hours.</p>
      <a href={`/request-a-quote/?ref=trip-${trip.slug}&nights=${trip.nights}&rounds=${trip.rounds}&partySize=${trip.groupSize}`}
